        <detaileddescription>
<para>Applies the omegaWallFunction kernel face-by-face.</para>
<para>ω_vis = 6ν / (β₁·y²) (viscous-sublayer estimate) ω_log = √k / (C_µ^0.25·κ·y) (log-layer estimate) ω_w = √(ω_vis² + ω_log²) (BINOMIAL n=2 blend)</para>
<para>Known limitations:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Single-patch-corner only: each wall cell is assumed to see at most one wall-function face. Meshes with re-entrant corners shared by two wall patches will diverge from multi-patch corner averaging.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>G (production) accumulation is not applied here; kOmegaSST computes G internally from nut·GbyNu0. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
